Z||000000||Dave85||09-13-1999||08:26 PM||||<BR>I was driving through town today, minding my own business. I pulled up to a light next to a Honda Accord. The light turns green and the Honda chirps and is off. My first response is floor it. I was actualy surprised at how fast I caught and passed HER. The next light, the guys that were behind me are now at my side. They're in a little mini truck waiting for their turn. Well they got it! I laughed as I watch them disappear in the rear view. ||||reg||10
