Z||000003||Greg Piet||09-14-1999||12:37 AM||||That story sounds extremely familiar.<BR>My stock 2.8 gets the same response.<BR>I have seen a lot of people pissed off at me at the next light.  The only problem is that they try to do it at the next light and the next light and the next light...<BR>When will people learn that their car isnt the fastest on the road no matter how low profile the tires are and no matter how big of an exhaust tip goes on the car.  ||||reg||1
